{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415012","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415012","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041501201:1":{"text":"이 약초들을 어떻게 하는 게 좋을까.","source_cn":"哎呀，这些草药可怎么办呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4EFB49CD22F872F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041501202:0":{"text":"그다지 신선하진 않지만... 대신 값이 엄청 싸잖아!","source_cn":"虽然不太新鲜，但——但它便宜啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC105AF458EB21AAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041501203:1":{"text":"싸다고?! 이게 어디가 싸!!!","source_cn":"便宜？！哪里有便宜货！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83B4562D1677A891","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041501204:1":{"text":"오오오, 이 약초들이야? 좋아, 좋아.","source_cn":"哦哦哦，就是这些吗？不错，不错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1290B7AAF8ED2D68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041501205:1":{"text":"자 그럼 정말 솔직하게 얼마나 더 깎아줄 수 있어?","source_cn":"那，老弟，你实话说，能便宜多少？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x629AC85BFD0F0D86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041501206:1":{"text":"이봐 형씨... 이 약초는 내가 할인해 주려고 특별히 남겨둔 재고야. 할인은 당연한 거지, 그런데 말이야...","source_cn":"哎呀，老兄，不是我说，这些草药可是我特意留到最后的压箱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA10C60BB8CA4539","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041501207:1":{"text":"내가 손해 본 거랑 보관료까지 다 따져서... 10%만 깎자고! 어때?","source_cn":"那么，算上折损和储存费用，就这个价吧：一折！你卖不卖？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98476AFB67632149","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041501208:1":{"text":"하하, 차라리 같이 한잔하면서 제대로 얘기해 보는 건 어때?","source_cn":"哼哼，看样子咱们得好好聊聊了，要不这样，老兄，咱们去喝一杯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2657667429FF956","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041501209:1":{"text":"내가 장기 거래처가 되어 줄 수 있어. 원하는 게 있으면 언제든 말하라고... 가격은, 웬만하면 다 맞춰줄 테니까 말이야.","source_cn":"我平时还能长期供货不少草药，你有什么要的，尽管跟我说…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x571BE268D847AB5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041501210:1":{"text":"많이 사면 깎아준다고? 흐음... 좋아. 그럼, 한잔하지! 이번엔 자네가 사게!","source_cn":"量大从优？咳嗯……不错啊。那，我们去喝一杯！这次你付账！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A5656DBBA652262","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿德":{"text":"에디","source":"阿德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿熏":{"text":"스모키","source":"阿熏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":2}}